                "entry_id": "9de72aef-d9a7-3157-9d7b-56838666f319",
                "word": "dumbwaiter",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "227ae95f-1f5c-429a-8123-a60e99b26c24",
                        "entry_id": "9de72aef-d9a7-3157-9d7b-56838666f319",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "dumbwaiters"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "172d2f44-b893-3e72-8002-4c5e1eab16dd",
                        "entry_id": "9de72aef-d9a7-3157-9d7b-56838666f319",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A small elevator used to move food etc. from one floor of a building to another."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b78833c-9b49-41f1-a4d8-c55b7f21b96b",
                                "sense_id": "172d2f44-b893-3e72-8002-4c5e1eab16dd",
                                "text": "When writing he had a copyin machine: while he was a-writin he wouldn't suffer nobody to come in his room: had a dumb-waiter: when he wanted anything he had nothin to do but turn a crank and the dumb-waiter would bring him water or fruit on a plate or anything he wanted."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b77fd598-ed27-3ff8-8463-0d1f718dc73d",
                        "entry_id": "9de72aef-d9a7-3157-9d7b-56838666f319",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A table or set of trays on rollers used for serving food."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "685a8dcc-2cbf-413f-bf5a-4181a1c21bd5",
                                "sense_id": "b77fd598-ed27-3ff8-8463-0d1f718dc73d",
                                "text": "Sauces, wines, all the accessories we wanted, and all of the best, were given out by our host from his dumbwaiter; and when they had made the circuit of the table, he always put them back again."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "28ec1b00-7812-36e6-89dd-0ad879e40a62",
                        "entry_id": "9de72aef-d9a7-3157-9d7b-56838666f319",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A lazy Susan."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5122de8b-03f2-4fb3-8cc6-71e00f2bf44f",
                        "source_entry_id": "9de72aef-d9a7-3157-9d7b-56838666f319",
                        "source_sense_description": "small elevator",
                        "target_lang_word": "monte-plat",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "monte-plat",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7725cc68-05e7-3f7d-b361-9b91b2165039",
                                        "entry_id": "6644553a-5611-3821-be23-7debfe2a997a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sorte de petit monte-charge qui sert à faire monter ou descendre les plats quand la cuisine n’est pas au même étage que la salle à manger."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8cdb13b-c767-447d-a849-53f15a356cba",
                                                "sense_id": "7725cc68-05e7-3f7d-b361-9b91b2165039",
                                                "text": "Au XVIᵉ siècle, les risques d’incendie étant mieux maîtrisés dans la construction civile, les cuisines sont installées sous la grande salle, de manière à ce que les plats parviennent chauds sur la table, montés par des serviteurs ou via des monte-plats, qui apparaissent à cette époque."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "615c74a1-29ee-4505-9988-ed9851b5d379",
                        "source_entry_id": "9de72aef-d9a7-3157-9d7b-56838666f319",
                        "source_sense_description": "small elevator",
                        "target_lang_word": "monte-plats",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "monte-plats",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ce539ad-958b-34d2-9fd7-bb29e86e5eb9",
                                        "entry_id": "04f10dcf-2805-3109-8924-2e2229c8876b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sorte de petit monte-charge qui sert à faire monter ou descendre les plats quand la cuisine n’est pas au même étage que la salle à manger."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e16368b3-9a1b-4912-8095-cd977f32e132",
                                                "sense_id": "8ce539ad-958b-34d2-9fd7-bb29e86e5eb9",
                                                "text": "Alors la bonne ouvrait une trappe, criait dans le vide du monte-plats :\n– La suite !\nEn bas, au plus profond de la cuisine grise, voûtée comme une chapelle, une petite femme maigre et laide qui mangeait sur un bout de table, se levait, prenait un plat dans le four, le glissait dans l'appareil élévateur."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed5b1e96-3f10-4a5d-a61d-7960c2a43ff5",
                                                "sense_id": "8ce539ad-958b-34d2-9fd7-bb29e86e5eb9",
                                                "text": "[…] une grande cuisine semblable à une chambre de torture avec ses broches, ses roues de monte-plats, ses cuves, son odeur de graillon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
